<section class="module-landing-banner mb-5" style="--hero-bg: url('../images/heroes/hero-insurance.jpg');" aria-label="Introduction">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="module-landing-accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="module-landing-kicker mb-2">Insurance & Risk Management</p>
        <h1 class="module-landing-headline text-white mb-3">Enterprise Insurance Management & Core Systems.</h1>
        <p class="module-landing-dek mb-4 col-lg-10 px-0">
            A comprehensive core system managing the full insurance value chain—from sophisticated 
            risk underwriting and policy administration to rapid claims settlement and 
            regulatory compliance.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a href="#components" class="btn btn-light btn-sm px-4 fw-semibold">Module components</a>
            <a href="/#inquiry" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm px-4">Start a conversation</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="row mb-5" id="components">

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Module Components</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
            Our insurance suite integrates critical operational layers into a unified core, ensuring 
            that underwriters, claims handlers, and compliance officers work from a single 
            immutable system of record.
        </p>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/insurance/dashboard">Dashboard</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    High-fidelity executive monitoring of gross written premiums (GWP), claims ratios, 
                    underwriting results, and broker production targets in real-time.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/insurance/policyadministration">Policy Administration</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Full lifecycle management from inception to renewal. Automated schedule generation, 
                    endorsement processing, and digitized document archival.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/insurance/underwriting">Underwriting & Rating</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Sophisticated risk assessment and configurable rating engines. Maintain pricing 
                    discipline through automated acceptance criteria and referral hierarchies.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/insurance/claims">Claims Management</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    End-to-end processing from First Notification of Loss (FNOL) to settlement. 
                    Manage reserves, assessor assignments, and salvage recoveries.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/insurance/reinsurance">Reinsurance Management</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Automated cession calculation for treaty and facultative arrangements. Manage 
                    bordereaux generation, claims recoveries, and technical account reconciliations.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/insurance/premiumcollection">Premium Collections</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Multi-tender receipting (USD/ZiG), instalment plan management, and automated 
                    follow-ups. Native integration with mobile money and bank platforms.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/insurance/brokermanagement">Intermediary Management</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Centralized management of brokers and agents. Track IPEC licenses, configure commission 
                    schedules, and generate authoritative intermediary statements.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/insurance/regulatory">Regulatory & Compliance</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Automated generation of IPEC quarterly returns, solvency margin calculations, 
                    and ZIMRA withholding tax reporting. Maintain an absolute audit trail.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Digital Policy Lifecycle & Self-Service</h2>
        <p>
            Modernize your distribution through a core system that supports the rapid creation and 
            management of complex insurance products. Our Policy Administration module 
            automates the generation of branded policy schedules and handles mid-term 
            adjustments (endorsements) with mechanical precision, ensuring that the 
            contractual record is always up to date.
        </p>
        <p>
            integrated client portals empower policyholders to view their schedules, download 
            tax certificates, and initiate claims notifications directly from their mobile 
            devices, significantly reducing the administrative burden on your back-office 
            teams.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Sophisticated Risk & Underwriting Control</h2>
        <p>
            Maintain underwriting profit through rigorous risk assessment and pricing discipline. 
            The underwriting engine allows for the definition of complex rating rules 
            per product class, ensuring that premiums are always aligned with the 
            assessed risk levels. Automated referral workflows ensure that high-value 
            or non-standard risks are escalated to senior underwriters, maintaining 
            organizational governance without slowing down standard production.
        </p>
        <p>
            NCD (No-Claims Discount) calculations and sum-insured adequacy checks are performed 
            automatically during the quotation phase, protecting the insurer from 
            under-insurance and maintaining the competitive accuracy of every quote.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Frictionless Claims & Settlement</h2>
        <p>
            The moment of truth in insurance is the claim. Our Claims Management module handles 
            the entire lifecycle from First Notification of Loss (FNOL) to final payment. 
            Automated reserve tracking and assessor assignment ensure that every claim is 
            processed efficiently, while detailed logs capture every communication and 
            assessment document, providing the transparency needed for audit and 
            dispute resolution.
        </p>
        <p>
            Settlement authorizations are tied to organizational authority limits, ensuring 
            that large payouts are reviewed by the appropriate level of management, 
            protecting organizational insurance funds while maintaining 
            speed of service to the insured.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Automated Reinsurance Cession</h2>
        <p>
            Protect your capital by automating the complex math of reinsurance. The system 
            automatically calculates treaty cessions on every policy inception, ensuring 
            that your risk exposure remains within authorized appetites. Facultative 
            placements are managed through a structured workflow, and technical 
            accounts are reconciled back to actual claims recoveries, ensuring that 
            your reinsurance receivables are always accurate and current.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-12 text-center">
        <p class="small mb-0">
            admin@pindah.org | +263 774 454 447
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
